OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader defends 'world
OL,4,Aclass' SEND officers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader has defended his
OL,7,F"world class" special educational needs
OL,8,Fand disabilities (SEND) officers after
OL,9,Fthey came under fire from a senior
OL,10,Fcouncillor.
OL,12,FSam Journet took aim at Essex County
OL,13,FCouncil staff as he resigned as cabinet
OL,14,Fmember for education in October, saying
OL,15,Fhe was "shocked" by some civil servants
OL,16,Fat the local authority.
OL,18,FHe criticised officers for refusing
OL,19,Fapplications for children's education
OL,20,Fhealth and care plans (EHCP) in certain
OL,21,Finstances.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
